{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">國家主席習近平結束印度行程返回北京。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">習近平在新德里前往機場途中，當地華僑華人和中資企業代表，揮舞中印兩國國旗，祝賀習近平出席金磚國家領導人峰會，圓滿成功。印度政府高級官員到機場送行。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.XI.DEPART-2300_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026xKqK7u534T1789311125.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.XI.DEPART-2300_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-13T14:58:48.217112+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":92,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}